  "question": {
    "text": "A bicycle tyre is filled with air having pressure of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>270</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kPa</mi></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. The approximate pressure of the air in the tyre when the temperature increases to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>36</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
